Archive of the diagnostic branches from the RK3308 6.1 -> 6.12 port
(docs/kernel-6.12-port.md on rithum-6.12, sections 4.2 and 10).

This commit has no content of its own. Its parents are the tips of the
branches below, so every commit those branches held stays reachable
after the branches themselves were deleted. Check any of them out by
hash. None of these trees is to ship.

